<section class="faq" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div><h2>Questions we hear often</h2><p class="lede">Something else on your mind? Talk to our engineers directly.</p></div>
    <div>
      <details><summary>Do we need to replace our existing machines?</summary><p>No. Ichibot works with the PLCs, meters and machines you already have, and adds retrofit sensors where data isn't available yet.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Where is our data stored?</summary><p>Your choice. Data can stay fully on-premise, go to the cloud, or both. The edge device always keeps a local log.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How long does a typical project take?</summary><p>A pilot on one line usually goes live in 2–6 weeks after the site survey, depending on the number of devices and integrations.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can it integrate with our ERP?</summary><p>Yes, through API, direct database connection or MQTT. We map the data together with your IT team during implementation.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What happens when the internet goes down?</summary><p>The edge device keeps collecting and logging data locally, and syncs automatically once the connection is back.</p></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
